OL,3,GNEWSACity Thameslink station to shut
OL,4,Afor seven months
OL,5,
OL,6,FCity Thameslink will close for more
OL,7,Fthan seven months from May 2027 while
OL,8,Fall 10 escalators are replaced.
OL,10,FThe station will shut until late
OL,11,FDecember 2027, although Thameslink
OL,12,Fservices will continue to run through
OL,13,Fthe area without stopping. Passengers
OL,14,Fare being advised to get on at
OL,15,FBlackfriars station instead.
OL,17,FNetwork Rail said the escalators, which
OL,18,Fhave been in service for more than 35
OL,19,Fyears, have reached the end of their
OL,20,Foperational life.
OL,23,APub: 02-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,326,320,200,140,0,100
