OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-$-%%%-!-%%%" ,%-$ -$%%-% ,,
OL,3,GNEWSACity Thameslink station to shut
OL,4,Afor seven months
OL,5,
OL,6,FLucy McAuliffe from Network Rail said
OL,7,Fthe lengthy closure was not a decision
OL,8,Fthey took lightly, but a single closure
OL,9,Fwas "the least disruptive and most
OL,10,Fefficient" way to carry the work.
